    "answer": {
      "short": "$2(x+2)^2-5$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x^2+8x+3&=2\\left(x^2+4x+\\frac32\\right)\\\\2x^2+8x+3&=2\\left((x+2)^2-4+\\frac32\\right)\\\\2x^2+8x+3&=2(x+2)^2-5.\\end{align*}$$",
